q 0 g BT 59.53 449.13 Td (D\) single-valued
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 420.78 Td (3.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 420.78 Td (\(1 point\) What a logical data model is used for:) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 406.61 Td (A\) For representing data requirements) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 392.43 Td (B\) For representing business logics) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 378.26 Td (C\) For representing how data is organized in a database) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 364.09 Td (D\) For representing how functions are performed
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 335.74 Td (4.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 335.74 Td (\(1 point\) \(check all that apply\) What is the difference between an ERD and a relational model) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 321.57 Td (A\) They are used in different stages of the database development) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 307.39 Td (B\) An ERD tells how records are organized and a relational model shows data requirements) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 293.22 Td (C\) A relational model tells how records are organized and an ERD shows data requirements) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 279.05 Td (D\) They use different sets of concepts, terminologies, and notations) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 264.87 Td (E\) They use unrelated sets of concepts, terminologies, and notations
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 236.53 Td (5.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 236.53 Td (\(1 point\) What is not correct about a record?) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 222.35 Td (A\) it is made of many values observed from one entity) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 208.18 Td (B\) it is usually linked to other records) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 194.01 Td (C\) it is made of a single value) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 179.83 Td (D\) it is also called a tuple) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 165.66 Td (E\) It is usually identifiable through some parts of the record
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 137.32 Td (6.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 137.32 Td (\(1 point\) What is not true about a hierarchical database?) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 123.14 Td (A\) records are linked by pointers) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 108.97 Td (B\) records are organized as an inverted tree) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 94.80 Td (C\) records are not identified by keys) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 80.62 Td (D\) it is not a dominant type of databases nowadays
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 52.28 Td (7.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 52.28 Td (\(1 point\) A relational database gets its name because) Tj ET Q
